{"id": "EUVD-2026-108757", "enisaUuid": "bd4e6c1d-efe4-3a21-8c2e-e5fb1c736d0f", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nbtrfs: always return -EIOCBQUEUED after btrfs_uring_read_extent_endio\n\nIf all bios finish before btrfs_encoded_read_regular_fill_pages()\nreturns, it calls btrfs_uring_read_extent_endio() and previously\nreturned the I/O status.  A negative errno then made\nbtrfs_uring_read_extent() unlock and free while\nbtrfs_uring_read_finished() did the same again.\n\nReturn -EIOCBQUEUED so only the deferred path cleans up.", "datePublished": "2026-10-23T12:19:31", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-23T12:19:31", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/033dda5b321f01661de518a8d5c8607ae8675b14", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a449433b0e3d4a3715d0bbee078f8c603f03c9f6", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/80a8dbb30d2b00b9c671b02bd73f700f6d20100f"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-98963"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0b193749-63d5-33a5-9d42-b01d240feb0b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "34310c442e175f286b4c06ab5caa4e0b267ea31c <a449433b0e3d4a3715d0bbee078f8c603f03c9f6"}, {"id": "1d9889df-62ec-34b4-9611-d016a8b46b39", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.13"}, {"id": "5a1c8f85-6f1e-304d-b6fe-8fb9f5932310", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "a0ca230e-6881-345f-9ecf-a653f3cea2d9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.11"}, {"id": "aa94f4f2-a5b0-384e-86b7-346d38bfdfb0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.57"}, {"id": "b3a2e7b5-6d2e-335c-a0f6-b43588066576", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "34310c442e175f286b4c06ab5caa4e0b267ea31c <80a8dbb30d2b00b9c671b02bd73f700f6d20100f"}, {"id": "c1d1e884-6eef-36bb-88bc-e5c4cd183364", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "ebb47aaa-ee14-3927-a8b0-5d9d143498ec", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "34310c442e175f286b4c06ab5caa4e0b267ea31c <033dda5b321f01661de518a8d5c8607ae8675b14"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "a1bbd86c-22c4-3899-8170-15eed96d0620", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}